		["references"] = <"Tobacco smoking summary, Published archetype [Internet]. openEHR Foundation, openEHR Clinical Knowledge Manager [cited: 2018-06-01]. Available from: https://ckm.openehr.org/ckm/#showArchetype_1013.1.2466

